{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>And he said.</b> The word \"entreat for me\" properly belonged first, for the sense is: entreat for me and this plague will cease, and then I will send you to sacrifice in the wilderness as you said — only on condition that you not go far, more than the three days."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:32:44.692970620Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}